<title>BELGIUM: SOCCER-TURKEY MOVE FOR GHANA STRIKER PREKO.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TURKEY MOVE FOR GHANA STRIKER PREKO.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anderlecht's Ghana striker Yaw Preko is joining Gaziantepspor of Turkey in a reported $1 million move.</p>
<p>An Anderlecht spokesman said on Monday that Preko would travel to Turkey on Thursday to sign a two-year contract.</p>
<p>-- Bert Lauwers, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
